T1  - When the algorithm enters the classroom: A critical integrative review of large language models, nursing education structural gaps, and the reconstitution of professional identity
AU  - Sun, Yanjie
AU  - Li, Hongzhou
AU  - Tao, Xiaohui
AU  - Zhou, Xujuan
AU  - Gururajan, Raj
AU  - Zhang, Ji
